  "definition": "Emergency Moorings",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-12-24",
  "historyNote": "#7940, eff 8-23-03; ss by #9975, eff 8-20-11 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Pda 500); ss by #12958, eff 12-24-19",
